# Android

- Mirror sibling feature modules/packages, DI, navigation, and networking.
- UI collects state; ViewModel/use case owns logic; no raw HTTP in Composables.
- Loading / empty / error / offline states for user flows.
- Sync API DTOs with backend OpenAPI when contracts change.
- Run `./gradlew` lint/test/assemble as in `project-context/COMMANDS.md` or `MOBILE.md`.
- Full skills: `rigor-os/skills/mobile/` (android-app, mobile-api-client, mobile-ui-ux).
